    "note": "Enrolled version read; passed Senate Mar 4 and House Mar 6, 2024. The task force studies extreme risk protection orders and voluntary firearm storage, among other topics, and reports by Sept 15, 2024 and Sept 15, 2025; it ends Dec 31, 2026 (SECTION 3)."
  },
  "operative_text": "SECTION 1 (new): (1) The Task Force on Community Safety and Firearm Suicide Prevention is established.\nSECTION 2 (new): In addition to and not in lieu of any other appropriation, there is appropriated to the Department of Justice, for the biennium ending June 30, 2025, out of the General Fund, the amount of $250,000, which may be expended for the purpose of paying a third party for research ordered by the Task Force on Community Safety and Firearm Suicide Prevention, as authorized under section 1 of this 2024 Act."
